{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Grow Idle Land you gather Resources to grow your island bit by bit! Just by standing nearby, idling your way up and recruit workers!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952030/extras/dd6fd9633a21e0ca5f677eb94f8e7ec5.poster.avif?t=1774458522\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952030/extras/dd6fd9633a21e0ca5f677eb94f8e7ec5.webm?t=1774458522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952030/extras/dd6fd9633a21e0ca5f677eb94f8e7ec5.mp4?t=1774458522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New buildings unlock new tools which unlock new paths to new upgrade possibilities! More Upgrades mean more Materials mean more to explore!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952030/extras/3e6ef2c801677afef58ad63c02d74a0a.poster.avif?t=1774458522\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952030/extras/3e6ef2c801677afef58ad63c02d74a0a.webm?t=1774458522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952030/extras/3e6ef2c801677afef58ad63c02d74a0a.mp4?t=1774458522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's an idle incremental game with simple moveable character in an isometric world. You idle by standing nearby or recruit workers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Upgrades enable you to Destroy rocks, build bridges, defeat enemies. All that just by moving there. No actual combat, just cozy idle to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start on a small sky island and end up on a big connected world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952030/extras/8822d671e3a3b51d477d601e485d5846.poster.avif?t=1774458522\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952030/extras/8822d671e3a3b51d477d601e485d5846.webm?t=1774458522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952030/extras/8822d671e3a3b51d477d601e485d5846.mp4?t=1774458522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow Idle Land in a nutshell:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An active incremental game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Game+ for permanent upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple diverse areas!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the definite End</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952030/extras/c96206ef8683b37bd89fc622a593bf0a.poster.avif?t=1774458522\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952030/extras/c96206ef8683b37bd89fc622a593bf0a.webm?t=1774458522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952030/extras/c96206ef8683b37bd89fc622a593bf0a.mp4?t=1774458522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/39